& [LimitsAndDecision]
  + independent evidence does not import the fixture producer and does reuse governed A1 through A6 verification implementations rather than claiming second cryptographic implementations
  + stable explicit-file reads reject links/reparse ancestry and bounded changes but do not promise an atomic filesystem snapshot against every concurrent replacement
  + development builds tests fixture writes and subprocesses are verification effects; runtime zero-effect fields describe the A6 receipt only
  + provider_unavailable zero live and synthetic trials; no WSL remote machine model download fallback persistent policy change foreign work collector broker or physical effect
  + implementation_verified_ready_for_exact_attributed_A6_publication_only; EOCV-033 and EOCV-A04 publication edges require the immediate successor bookend
